laurel 2961: GPU DCVS with all stock levels to 950 MHz. PLL1 320/465, GPLL0 300/600, PLL0 745/820/900/950 (new iokit/Kernel/arm/laurel_gpu_opp.h: table, governor, order of the votes, tested on the host by scripts/laurel/test-gpu-opp.sh). Raise: CX iPeak (from 900 MHz, stock), DDR at the stock bus level, CX at the stock corner, PLL lock, RCG, clock read. Lower: the reverse. A PLL is programmed only while it is stopped: the RCG waits on GPLL0. Self-check at each level; a failed level goes out of the table, a failed fallback gives off. Thermal: Android gpu-step 95 C, gpu-cx-mon 100 C. Kill switches gpudcvs=0, gpupll=0.

